      "content": "honoring them or whatever doesnt stop the fact that they are gone and i am still here. it just feels like the universe made a mistake. i’m just a burden to everyone because they have to deal with my guilt and my sadness. if i wasn't here, maybe the world would just feel more balanced. like things would actually make sense again.",
